$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 CS {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Comsig"
  m_sTextData "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
  "• HQ - 31HQ"\
  "• 1SEC - 31Alpha"\
  "• 2SEC - 31Bravo"\
  "• WEP - 31Charlie"\
  ""\
  "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
  "• Platoon net - 42hz"\
  ""\
  "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
  "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
  "• <b>Challenge:</b> Donkey | <b>Password:</b> Squadron"\
  "• Running password: 57"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 5
 }
 EF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Enemy forces consist of a platoon+ of FIA personnel, concentrated around the hamlet of Joutkallio and the surrounding terrain. Their known limits of advance appear to be the main supply route to the west and the dirt track to the south."\
  ""\
  "The terrain around Joutkallio contains numerous large boulders providing ample hard cover, even across otherwise open ground. Vegetation is sparser than in surrounding areas, providing generally better observation, although numerous long-running depressions in the terrain allow for concealed movement and rapid repositioning."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• No armoured vehicle capabilities."\
  "• They possess organic offensive and reconnaissance drone capabilities."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• No reinforcements. This cell has been cut off, fixed, and isolated. Expect the FIA to make a final stand."\
  "• Very limited remaining supplies. The cell has been operating mostly on foot for several days, following repeated skirmishes."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are <b>1st platoon, C Company, 3rd Battalion, Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry (3 PPCLI)</b>, consisting of 32 personnel. Currently staging at a barnyard southwest of the FIA's position, preparing to conduct our assault on Joutkallio."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• We have 2x JLTVs equipped with .50cal HMGs available to provide mobile direct-fire support."\
  "- Note: Theres 4x unarmed JLTVs at the staging area but these <i>will</i> remain behind, as the short distance to the objective makes them unnecessary for the assault. "\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• 2nd platoon and 3rd platoon have set up their blocking positions south-east and north-west of us."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE ASSAULT</b> to <b>DESTROY</b> the FIA cell by <b>SWEEPING</b> the area and <b>SECURING</b>the hamlet of Joutkallio."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "The remaining FIA cell has been isolated within Joutkallio following several days of pursuit and repeated skirmishes after our major battle last week. Their escape routes have been cut off, their supplies are running low, and no reinforcements are coming. They are now fixed in position and preparing to make a final stand."\
  ""\
  "We are to assault Joutkallio, <b>CLEAR</b> the surrounding terrain and built-up area in order to <b>DESTROY</b> the cell and <b>SECURE</b> the area once again."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  "DTL: 28/05/2025, 1335hrs, Joutkallio, Ruha."\
  "Weather: Cloudy, with no forecast of change."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "Canadian forces have been operating in Ruha as part of an ongoing security operation against the FIA, whose continued activity throughout the region has threatened local stability and freedom of movement."\
  ""\
  "Several days ago, Canadian forces engaged a large FIA formation during a major clash in the region. The engagement resulted in the destruction of the majority of the FIA company, but several elements managed to break contact and escape into the surrounding countryside."\
  ""\
  "One of these elements, a small FIA cell, has remained on the move ever since. Canadian forces have been tracking their movements and applying pressure for several days, gradually cutting off their escape routes and forcing them further into the countryside."\
  ""\
  "The pursuit has now reached Joutkallio. With their routes out of the area cut off and Canadian forces having finally caught up, the remaining FIA cell has been isolated and fixed in position."\
  ""\
  "The Canadians now have an opportunity to finish what they started and destroy the remaining FIA force."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_CAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}